    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d930">

                <pb facs="0893" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg579"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-14T16:00:00-05:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">December 14, 1914, 4 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>I have explained to Ambassador Spring Rice that Mr. Hitchcock did not consult the
                    President or State Department in regard to his resolution. Though from Nebraska
                    he is not personally friendly to me.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
